Z||000007||kempo||09-29-2001||10:19 AM||||I once failed with similar results.  I think I had a dumbass who didn't know what he was doing fail me.  Anyway, I had purchased a new air filter, o2 sensor, and for what is was worth, spark plugs.  Took it back the next day and it passed.<BR>Also look at your local auto store, they make a product called "Emission Pass" which gaurantees you to pass emissions.  Worth a shot.  Good luck.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.admist.net/kempsig.jpg"> <BR>87 Fiero GT / 5 Speed<BR>86 Fiero 2m4 - FOR SALE||||reg||1
